cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SmallGrants: an open index of US foundation giving from IRS Form 990-PF filings"
message: "If you use this software or corpus, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Klaus
    given-names: Johnny
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/smallgrants"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that turns IRS Form 990-PF bulk XML into a searchable
  index of 8,388,280 grant records from 142,806 US private foundations, with a
  web application that ranks funders against a described project and reviews a
  specific ask against each foundation's own filing.
keywords:
  - philanthropy
  - nonprofit
  - Form 990-PF
  - open data
  - entity resolution
